  "target_selection_rule": "Applied to dataset metadata only (sampling frequency, domain family, Chronos-2 pretraining provenance, number of test series), never to any transfer or truncation result. R1: no Electricity dataset (series siblings), so every target's source pool is all 13 other datasets, as in the Phase 2c main protocol. R2: the test split reaches the full 262-series budget (excludes SZ Taxi, 156 series, and Coastal T-S, 24), so every target has comparable statistical power. R3: four distinct sampling frequencies, all three provenance groups (held out / not listed / listed), four distinct domain families. R4: ties go to more targets held out from Chronos-2 pretraining (the strictest zero-shot case: unseen by the backbone and by the adapter), then to roster order.",
